[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Open the bonnet lid and disconnect the\nnegative battery terminal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584248\">1056B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584360\">1056B87</a></p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) and remove the rear seal for the camshaft\ninvolved (1b).</p><p>2. Recover the wiring mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021138.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Replace the camshaft rear cover gasket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021139.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Place the camshaft  rear seal, complete\nwith wiring mounting bracket back in its housing and fix it tightening\nthe nuts  to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>INTAKE AND EXHAUST CAMSHAFT REAR COVER</p></td><td><p>M7</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.5</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584360\">1056B87</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584248\">1056B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584356\">1048A32</a></p><p>Connect the negative battery terminal and\nclose the bonnet lid.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">A1</span></p></td></tr></table></div>"]]